<title>USA: Southern Missouri says to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Southern Missouri says to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>POPLAR BLUFF, Mo. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Missouri Bancorp Inc said on Friday that it will repurchase up to 81,895 shares, or about five percent, of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be repurchased on the open market or in private transactions during the next nine months, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be used for issuance in connection with the exercise of stock options as well as for general corporate purposes, the company added.</p>
